            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## 中文

- 在「应用全屏时」选择「淡出隐藏」，现在会同时停止系统音频采集，释放音频采集资源，让 PrismPulse 触发的录音标记消失。
- 退出全屏后，如果系统音频原本开启，会在有声音播放时自动恢复采集。

支持 macOS 14.4 及以上，包含 Apple 芯片和 Intel 版本。可在菜单栏选择「检查更新…」安装。

## English

- With Fade Out selected for full-screen apps, PrismPulse now stops capturing system audio and releases its capture session as the overlay fades. This removes the recording indicator triggered by PrismPulse.
- On leaving full screen, PrismPulse resumes capture when playback is active if audio capture was enabled.

Requires macOS 14.4 or later and supports Apple silicon and Intel. Choose Check for Updates from the PrismPulse menu to install.
]]></description>
